<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100303" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπι-σημαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help to indicate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ τοῦ θεοῦ προνοίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.398a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.188
			</span></i>: mostly in 
				Med.
			, <i>join in expressing a judgement of</i> a thing (c.
			acc.), whether in disapproval, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.24.4
			</span></i>; or in approval, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>explain:</i> or <i>interpret in addition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).600
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
